,{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 60.0%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.45"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":23.94,"default_fair_val":23.94,"premium_pct":76.4,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":45.4,"pe_forward":40,"pb_trailing":1.2,"pb_forward":1.1,"div_yield":4.16,"ps_ratio":5.5,"fcf_to_ev":2.85,"fcf_to_mcap":4.58,"liab_to_assets":60,"cash_to_assets":1.5,"current_ratio":1.45,"roe":2.7,"roa":1.1,"moat":{"ticker":"SW","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Smurfit Kappa 與 WestRock 合併後，公司在包裝行業的品牌影響力有所提升，尤其是在歐洲市場。然而，包裝行業本質上仍偏向商品化，定價權相對有限，主要受原材料成本和市場供需影響。雖然公司致力於提供差異化解決方案，但面對眾多競爭者，其品牌溢價能力仍有待加強，難以形成顯著的定價壁壘。","comment_en":"Following the merger of Smurfit Kappa and WestRock, the company has enhanced its brand presence in the packaging industry, particularly in the European market. However, the packaging sector remains largely commoditized, with pricing power being relatively limited, primarily influenced by raw material costs and market supply/demand dynamics. While the company strives to offer differentiated solutions, its ability to command premium pricing is constrained by numerous competitors, preventing the establishment of a significant pricing barrier."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"包裝行業的進入門檻相對較低，技術創新和專利保護並非核心競爭力。Smurfit WestRock 的業務模式不依賴於專利或特許經營權。雖然公司在可持續包裝材料和生產工藝上有所研發，但這些創新難以形成持久的、法律保護的獨特壁壘，競爭對手可以相對容易地模仿或開發替代方案。","comment_en":"The packaging industry generally has low barriers to entry, and technological innovation or patent protection is not a core competitive strength for Smurfit WestRock. The company's business model does not rely on patents or regulatory licenses. While R&D efforts exist in sustainable packaging materials and production processes, these innovations are unlikely to form durable, legally protected moats, as competitors can relatively easily imitate or develop alternative solutions."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"對於大型客戶而言，更換包裝供應商涉及供應鏈的重新整合、設備調整以及質量驗證等成本，這構成了一定的轉換成本。Smurfit WestRock 透過提供客製化包裝設計、供應鏈管理服務和可靠的交付能力，與客戶建立長期合作關係，從而提高客戶的轉換難度。然而，這些成本並非絕對，尤其是在價格敏感的市場中。","comment_en":"For large clients, switching packaging suppliers involves costs related to supply chain reintegration, equipment adjustments, and quality validation, creating a moderate level of switching costs. Smurfit WestRock fosters long-term relationships by offering customized packaging designs, supply chain management services, and reliable delivery, thereby increasing the difficulty for clients to switch. However, these costs are not absolute, especially in price-sensitive market segments."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Smurfit WestRock 的業務模式不具備顯著的網絡效應。其產品和服務的價值主要取決於自身的生產能力、產品質量和客戶服務，而非用戶之間的互動或連接。公司無法從用戶數量的增加中獲得指數級的價值提升，這使得其難以形成像社交網絡或市場平台那樣的強大網絡效應壁壘。","comment_en":"Smurfit WestRock's business model does not exhibit significant network effects. The value of its products and services primarily depends on its own production capacity, product quality, and customer service, rather than user interactions or connections. The company does not benefit from exponential value increases as user numbers grow, making it difficult to establish strong network effect moats akin to social networks or marketplaces."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"合併後的 Smurfit WestRock 成為全球最大的包裝公司之一，擁有巨大的規模優勢。這使其在採購原材料（如紙漿、廢紙）時具有更強的議價能力，從而降低單位生產成本。同時，龐大的生產網絡和物流體系也帶來了運營效率的提升。這種規模經濟是其在成本上超越小型競爭者的關鍵壁壘。","comment_en":"The merged Smurfit WestRock is one of the world's largest packaging companies, possessing significant economies of scale. This grants it superior bargaining power when procuring raw materials like pulp and recycled paper, thereby lowering per-unit production costs. Furthermore, its extensive production network and logistics system contribute to operational efficiencies. This scale advantage serves as a key barrier, enabling it to outperform smaller competitors on cost."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Smurfit WestRock 擁有廣泛的全球生產和分銷網絡，尤其在北美和歐洲市場佔據領先地位。這種地理上的佈局使其能夠貼近客戶，提供快速響應的服務，並優化物流成本。雖然其他包裝公司也可能在特定地區擁有優勢，但 Smurfit WestRock 整合後的全球覆蓋範圍和市場滲透率構成了難以複製的地理資產壁壘。","comment_en":"Smurfit WestRock boasts an extensive global manufacturing and distribution network, holding leading positions particularly in North America and Europe. This geographical footprint allows it to be close to customers, offer rapid response services, and optimize logistics costs. While other packaging companies may have strengths in specific regions, the integrated global coverage and market penetration of Smurfit WestRock form a difficult-to-replicate geographical asset moat."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"通過整合 Smurfit Kappa 和 WestRock 的運營，公司有潛力實現顯著的協同效應和運營效率提升。這包括優化生產流程、減少冗餘開支、以及利用最佳實踐。公司在可持續發展和循環經濟方面的投入，也體現了其對高效資源利用的追求。持續的效率改進是維持競爭力的重要因素。","comment_en":"By integrating the operations of Smurfit Kappa and WestRock, the company has the potential to achieve significant synergies and operational efficiencies. This includes optimizing production processes, reducing redundant expenditures, and leveraging best practices. Investments in sustainability and the circular economy also reflect a commitment to efficient resource utilization. Continuous efficiency improvements are crucial for maintaining competitiveness."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"公司管理層在資本配置方面面臨挑戰，尤其是在整合大型合併案後。需要平衡債務償還、股息支付、股票回購和再投資於業務增長之間的關係。雖然過去的資本配置決策（如此次合併）顯示了其擴張的雄心，但其 ROE 和 ROA 水平相對較低，表明資本配置的效率有待提高，以產生更高的股東回報。","comment_en":"Management faces challenges in capital allocation, especially post-merger of large entities. Balancing debt repayment, dividends, share buybacks, and reinvestment in business growth is key. While past decisions, like the recent merger, show ambition, the relatively low ROE and ROA suggest room for improvement in capital allocation efficiency to generate higher shareholder returns."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Smurfit WestRock 通過提供全面的包裝解決方案，包括設計、生產、物流和可持續性建議，努力提高客戶黏性。與主要客戶建立的長期合作關係，以及對客戶需求的深入理解，有助於維持較高的客戶留存率。然而，包裝行業的競爭激烈，客戶仍可能尋求更具成本效益的替代方案，因此客戶黏性並非牢不可破。","comment_en":"Smurfit WestRock strives for customer stickiness by offering comprehensive packaging solutions, including design, production, logistics, and sustainability advice. Long-term partnerships with key clients and a deep understanding of their needs contribute to maintaining high retention rates. However, the intense competition in the packaging industry means clients may still seek more cost-effective alternatives, thus customer loyalty is not absolute."},"m10_durability":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"包裝行業是現代經濟的基礎設施，對各種消費品和工業品的需求穩定，這賦予了 Smurfit WestRock 業務一定的持久性。然而，該行業易受宏觀經濟週期、原材料價格波動和環保法規變化的影響。雖然公司在可持續包裝領域的投入有助於應對未來趨勢，但其業務的長期穩定性仍面臨一定的外部挑戰。","comment_en":"The packaging industry serves as a fundamental part of the modern economy, with stable demand for various consumer and industrial goods, lending a degree of durability to Smurfit WestRock's business. However, the sector is susceptible to macroeconomic cycles, raw material price volatility, and evolving environmental regulations. While investments in sustainable packaging help address future trends, the long-term stability of its operations faces certain external challenges."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Smurfit WestRock 憑藉其合併後形成的龐大規模和全球佈局，在成本和地理覆蓋方面建立了顯著的競爭優勢，這使其在包裝行業中具有一定的護城河。其規模經濟帶來了採購和生產成本的優勢，而廣泛的網絡則能更好地服務客戶。然而，該行業的商品化屬性限制了其定價權，且網絡效應和專利壁壘幾乎不存在。客戶轉換成本和運營效率提供了一定的保護，但並非堅不可摧。總體而言，Smurfit WestRock 屬於一個具有規模和網絡優勢的『成本領導者』或『基礎設施型』企業，其護城河相對堅固但並非無懈可擊，易受週期性和原材料價格波動影響。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Smurfit WestRock possesses a moat primarily built on cost leadership and geographical reach, stemming from its significant scale post-merger and global presence. Economies of scale provide advantages in procurement and production costs, while its extensive network facilitates customer service. However, the commoditized nature of the industry limits pricing power, and network effects or patent-based moats are virtually absent. Switching costs and operational efficiencies offer some protection but are not insurmountable. Overall, SW operates as a 'cost leader' or 'infrastructure-like' business with scale and network advantages. Its moat is solid but not impregnable, susceptible to cyclicality and raw material price fluctuations.","evidenceHash":"0fe4e83916b4ba570f5d1beeb740b955f334550a218ee5bd83634d8564dc2711","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"2de98bc2458df1151b2aa4fb206b87bd9c4e9ce2802a896d60b29e9f2a903645"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"2de98bc2458df1151b2aa4fb206b87bd9c4e9ce2802a896d60b29e9f2a903645"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SW.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SW.png","website":"https://www.smurfitwestrock.com","ceo":"Anthony Paul J. Smurfit","full_time_employees":"97000","description":"Smurfit Westrock Plc, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures, distributes, and sells containerboard, corrugated containers, and other paper-based packaging products in North America, South America, Europe, Asia, Africa, Australia, and internationally. The company produces containerboard and paperboard; packaging of corrugated containers; consumer packaging; and offers solid board, kraft paper, and graphic board, as well as other packaging products, such as solidboard packaging, paper sacks and bag-in-box. It produces linerboard and corrugated medium and paperboard; and other paper-based packaging, such as folding cartons, inserts, labels and displays. The company primarily serves food and beverage, healthcare, beauty and personal care, garden, consumer goods, industrial, and foodservice markets. It markets its products through its own sales force, independent sales representatives, and independent distributors. Smurfit Westrock Plc was founded in 1934 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.","description_en":"Smurfit Westrock Plc, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures, distributes, and sells containerboard, corrugated containers, and other paper-based packaging products in North America, South America, Europe, Asia, Africa, Australia, and internationally. The company produces containerboard and paperboard; packaging of corrugated containers; consumer packaging; and offers solid board, kraft paper, and graphic board, as well as other packaging products, such as solidboard packaging, paper sacks and bag-in-box. It produces linerboard and corrugated medium and paperboard; and other paper-based packaging, such as folding cartons, inserts, labels and displays. The company primarily serves food and beverage, healthcare, beauty and personal care, garden, consumer goods, industrial, and foodservice markets. It markets its products through its own sales force, independent sales representatives, and independent distributors. Smurfit Westrock Plc was founded in 1934 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.","description_zh":"**Smurfit Westrock Plc (SW) 業務營運概述**\n\nSmurfit Westrock Plc (SW) 是一家全球領先的紙基包裝解決方案供應商，業務遍及北美、南美、歐洲、亞洲、非洲、澳洲及全球其他地區。公司核心業務聚焦於生產與銷售各類紙基包裝產品，主要包括：\n\n*   **包裝用紙 (Containerboard) 與紙板 (Paperboard)：** 生產用於製造瓦楞紙箱的底紙 (linerboard) 與芯紙 (corrugated medium)，以及其他紙板產品。\n*   **瓦楞紙箱 (Corrugated Containers)：** 製造各類尺寸與規格的瓦楞紙箱，滿足多元化運輸與保護需求。\n*   **消費品包裝 (Consumer Packaging)：** 提供包括摺疊紙盒 (folding cartons)、內襯 (inserts)、標籤 (labels) 與展示架 (displays) 等，專為消費品市場設計。\n*   **其他紙基包裝產品：** 涵蓋固體紙板 (solid board)、牛皮紙 (kraft paper)、圖文紙板 (graphic board)，以及紙袋 (paper sacks) 與盒中袋 (bag-in-box) 等創新包裝形式。\n\nSW 的營運模式整合了從原物料採購、生產製造到終端銷售的完整價值鏈。公司主要服務的市場包括食品飲料、醫療保健、美妝個護、園藝、消費品、工業品及餐飲服務等。透過自有銷售團隊、獨立銷售代表及經銷商網絡，SW 將其高品質的包裝解決方案推向全球市場。","address":"Beech Hill","city":"Dublin","state":"DU","zip":"D04 N2R2","country":"IE","phone":"353 1 202 7000","full_address":"Beech Hill, Dublin, DU D04 N2R2, IE","range_52w":"32.729-52.65","year_high":52.65,"year_low":32.729,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":32.729,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-14","name":"SMURFIT ANTHONY P J","title":"director, officer: President and CEO","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":486,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-14","name":"SMURFIT ANTHONY P J","title":"director, officer: President and CEO","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":910,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-14","name":"Page Irene","title":"officer: Chief Accounting Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":23,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-14","name":"Page Irene","title":"officer: Chief Accounting Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":152,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-14","name":"Mayer Saverio","title":"officer: See remarks","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":119,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-14","name":"Mayer Saverio","title":"officer: See remarks","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":403,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-14","name":"Henao Alvaro","title":"officer: See remarks","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":35,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-14","name":"Henao Alvaro","title":"officer: See remarks","is_buy":null,"action":"A